@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# JSON Pointer (RFC 6901)
+
+`resolvePointer(document, pointer)` is exported from `src/index.ts`.
+
+- `""` returns the whole document.
+- Otherwise the pointer must start with `/`; tokens are split on `/`, `~1` -> `/`, `~0` -> `~`; any other `~` sequence is invalid (throws).
+- Arrays: token must be `0` or digits without leading zeros and in range; `-` and out-of-range throw.
+- Objects: only own members; missing members throw (incl. `__proto__`, inherited names).
+- Descending into a scalar (including `null`) throws. A member whose value is `null` resolves to `null`.
+- Only the string form is supported (not the URI fragment form).
diff --git a/src/index.test.ts b/src/index.test.ts
